      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To track the semantic gaps, consider creating a spreadsheet or database with columns for:\n\n1. Date range\n2. Synonym cluster\n3. Specific words or phrases being phased out\n4. Comparative usage rates (pre- and post-acquisition/epoch) \n5. Any patterns or correlations between the absent words\n\nYou can manually or script-wise query various datasets to monitor usage rates, and estimate semantic gaps by comparing out-of-vocabulary and persisted words in each cluster per dropped word transition periods.",
